fcpi patch 0003: the pi-resilient engine adapter (FIRECRAWL_PI_SPEC.md §8)
Upstream 7666c1f9. Adds engines/pi-resilient (the adapter and the retrieval-service client) and registers it as
the only engine when PI_RETRIEVAL_URL is set; config.ts refuses the profile beside another engine or
ALLOW_LOCAL_WEBHOOKS. Forced "fetch" engines (robots.txt, sitemaps) go to it, the typed PiRetrievalError ends
the engine loop, and skipTlsVerification defaults to false in the profile.

